            <ArticleTitle>Painful nocturnal penile erections associated with rapid eye movement sleep.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>184-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>A case of chronic painful nocturnal penile erection is described. Repeated awakenings led to a degree of REM sleep deprivation. Treatment with propanolol was initially successful in alleviating the symptoms, but tolerance to the drug developed rapidly.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
